% equator.glp - Equator creation for many-to-one signaling
%
% An equator is a term '_equator'(E, C) where:
% - E is a writer (the trigger)
% - C is a constant (the collapse value)
%
% Multiple processes can receive the equator structure and trigger it,
% but only the controller holding E? detects when it fires.

% Create an equator with collapse value C
% Returns: Eq = '_equator'(E, C) with fresh writer E
%          Handle = E? (the reader, for controller to detect trigger)
create_equator(C, '_equator'(E, C?), E?).
